# Shared Firebase

**Locked 22 Sep 2026.** Detail: `docs/shared-firebase.md`.

Firestore is shared with Flight Report and other apps this repo does not control. `merge: true` overwrites every key you send, including a new string shape or type.

## Do not

- Rewrite a stored date, timestamp, or id into a shorter or “cleaner” form (`M/YY` vs `MM/01/YYYY`, Firestore `Timestamp` vs ISO string, `null` vs omit).
- Post a loaded document (`fullPilot`, modal clone, parent PFR) so fields you did not mean to change go back.
- “Fix” another app by changing the payload. Match the pattern already on the document.

## Already locked

- Training exp stores `MM/01/YYYY`. Screens may show `MM/YY`.
- `firebaseMin` writes `release/releaseStatus` only. See `docs/flight-release-firebase.md`.
- `pilots` writes are allowlisted. See `docs/pilot-firebase-writes.md`.
